hero2NativeAPP — licence status
===============================

NO LICENCE IS GRANTED.

The code written for it is
Copyright (c) 2026 the repository owner, all rights reserved. No permission to use,
copy, modify or distribute it is given to anyone.

That is the DEFAULT position under copyright law, not a decision — it is written down
here only so the absence of a licence file cannot be mistaken for permission. The
owner may replace this file with a real licence at any time. Until they do, all rights
in that code are reserved.


What this file does NOT cover
-----------------------------
1. `vendor/` — five vendored forks of other people's crates, each governed by its own
   upstream licence file (MIT, MIT-or-Apache-2.0, and one LGPL-2.1). They are NOT
   relicensed by anything above. See `UPSTREAM.txt` for the list, the upstream URLs,
   what each fork changes, and the LGPL-2.1 note that matters before any binary is
   handed to a third party.

2. 영웅서기2 (Heroes Lore: Knight of the Frozen Sea) — the game. The repackaged
   archive is included only so the app builds. It is not covered by anything here and
   no claim is made to it.
   Copyright in the game belongs to its rights holders.

3. Reverse engineering notes (`tools_re/dis/*`, `HERO2_*.md`) describe that game's
   binary. They are observations about someone else's work.
